# ---- AYG ----------------------------------------------------------------
# Notes for AI assistants: local working documents, never part of a release.
CLAUDE.md
**/CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
**/AGENTS.md
.claude/
**/.claude/

# Signing material — the backstop that keeps a stray certificate or profile
# from ever being added by hand or by `git add .`.
*.mobileprovision
*.provisionprofile
*.p12
*.p8
*.pem
*.key
*.certSigningRequest
codesigning-adhoc/
codesigning-appstore/

# api_id / api_hash registered on my.telegram.org. Publishing these lets anyone
# impersonate this client to Telegram and gets the pair revoked. The development
# configuration carries only Telegram's public simulator test pair, but it is
# kept out of the index anyway so the release configs never get a precedent.
build-system/AYGDevelopmentConfiguration.json
build-system/AYGAdHocConfiguration.json
build-system/AYGAppStoreConfiguration.json
codesigning-adhoc-ayugram/
codesigning-appstore-ayugram/
# The Xcode pin XTGXcodeConfig.sh derives from `xcode-select` before every build.
build-system/XTGXcode/
build-system/XTGXcode.bazelrc

# bazel output symlink of this checkout, whatever its directory is called
# (upstream only lists bazel-telegram-ios).
/bazel-*

